---
// Added in the figures pass: numbers come from the post text and captures.
const W = 900, H = 310;
---
<figure class="bep5a">
  <div class="bep5a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A bar from 12:15 ET to 7:04 ET, about 6 hours 49 minutes, labelled as a host that looked healthy. Below it three boxes in a chain: queries deadlock and locked connections never return; the pool has no query timeouts so slots stay occupied; the health check never touches the database so the host looks fine.">
    <text x="450" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>about 6 h 49 min of a host that looked healthy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khoảng 6 giờ 49 phút một con host trông vẫn khỏe</tspan></text>
    <rect x="60" y="90" width="780" height="30" rx="6" class="badfill" />
    <line x1="60" y1="128" x2="60" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <line x1="840" y1="128" x2="840" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <text x="60" y="158" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>12:15 ET: the host stalls on most requests</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>12:15 ET: host kẹt gần hết request</tspan></text>
    <text x="840" y="158" text-anchor="end" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>7:04 ET: engineers terminate it after a user report</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>7:04 ET: kỹ sư tắt host sau khi có người dùng báo</tspan></text>
    <rect x="60" y="200" width="240" height="72" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="180" y="229" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>queries deadlock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>query bị deadlock</tspan></text>
    <text x="180" y="251" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>locked connections never return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>connection bị khóa không trả lại</tspan></text>
    <line x1="300" y1="236" x2="320" y2="236" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="330,236 320,231 320,241" class="hd" />
    <rect x="330" y="200" width="240" height="72" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="450" y="229" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>pool has no query timeouts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool không có query timeout</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="251" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>slots stay occupied for good</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>slot bị chiếm vĩnh viễn</tspan></text>
    <line x1="570" y1="236" x2="590" y2="236" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="600,236 590,231 590,241" class="hd" />
    <rect x="600" y="200" width="240" height="72" rx="8" class="badfill" />
    <text x="720" y="229" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>health check never touches</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>health check không chạm tới</tspan></text>
    <text x="720" y="251" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>the database: host looks fine</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>database: host vẫn trông khỏe</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The Val Town outage as a chain: a deadlock, a pool that never took its slots back, and a health check that never looked at the database.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vụ Val Town như một chuỗi: deadlock, pool không bao giờ lấy lại slot, và health check không hề nhìn vào database.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5a text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5a .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5a .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5a .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5a .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5a .badfill { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5a .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5a .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5a .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5a .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5a .dotbad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5a .slot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
